{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深圳APEC｜日本首相高市早苗抵埗　外界關注她與中方互動\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APEC-JP-261118-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】日本首相高市早苗由馬尼拉轉抵深圳。</p><p>高市早苗在菲律賓出席完東盟系列會議後，乘坐飛機轉抵深圳，準備出席APEC領導人非正式會議，是高市就任日本首相後首次到訪中國。</p><p>國家主席習近平今晚設宴歡迎出席峰會的領袖，日本傳媒關注高市與中方領導人的互動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.120417+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:31:15.536688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:32.221677+00:00","content_hash":"fb9ee4b403987f04ee51b8fe5aab9e2da86dd80ac1a76b686ca417191f185a40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.120417+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}